></span></div><div data-rid="d274171e-d13b-483f-9139-c5f637fe0e03" class="r-1diglez alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>U.S. History</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="79534670-d7a3-442a-a435-cf0f59393817" class="r-wc1hui" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="73bb8c6b-7602-46c5-bbc8-58f291fb6b58" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rctj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1dcznbx"><div data-rid="17f0fbb1-d8c1-41c5-9e9c-401581e8dbb3" class="r-18ywhvg alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Katie Kimball</p></span></div><div data-rid="e219041d-0bb5-4e4a-9946-4f2f8fa89b32" class="r-gq9hi2" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" id="replo-:Rctj2:"><div data-rid="5c2b30fa-a48b-4614-8123-9e8627e7777c" class="r-1o7h32l"><div data-rid="b6a0331d-2bcc-4e2d-a793-8c9e5a00c455" class="r-hpeip9"></div><picture data-rid="a0d216c6-47b2-4728-abe2-83cbc34632ea" class="r-68r6jo"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/31c22264-3d76-423a-a7db-d7b7c38902c1?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/ea30092e-13e5-49f9-b2f2-42b6f595f789?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/ea30092e-13e5-49f9-b2f2-42b6f595f789?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/ea30092e-13e5-49f9-b2f2-42b6f595f789" class="r-5u55nd" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="cce8a561-a70b-4a38-b6d3-5e21dd42fde4" class="r-hmmakk"><div data-rid="ec7bbf34-7792-4553-9186-9e5adeff9396" class="r-mz3cx5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Katie Kimball</p></span></div><div data-rid="067b105b-bef6-4e0d-9602-b44a65020e59" class="r-lhpmxv"><picture data-rid="34c8c1f6-a7a3-46a6-be8f-3a881b0a7562" class="r-6p0dak"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/c502acfd-237f-442d-9eef-e47ed6136f27?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/c502acfd-237f-442d-9eef-e47ed6136f27?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/c502acfd-237f-442d-9eef-e47ed6136f27?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/c502acfd-237f-442d-9eef-e47ed6136f27" class="r-14w11qw" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="04a79abe-788a-4b1e-b729-0b2ad66ec54b" class="r-7z3tv5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Author, Speaker & Family Educator</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="b6224b79-bedc-459a-8ba3-e0433ade8010" class="r-1iwz2nx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Katie teaches the character and life skills that turn teens into people others genuinely want around. Her lessons are grounded, practical, and built for families who want their kids to be good at life — not just good at passing tests.</p></span></div><div data-rid="3af650fe-4b30-47ec-a22a-fe00f1b78b87" class="r-18czjyc"><div data-rid="4beeec3c-7e7f-4e39-8540-673717a08fdd" class="r-5l8ru2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Character</p></span></div><div data-rid="23ae8508-e839-4308-9031-9fa93b431736" class="r-147vr7e alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Family Leadership</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="73ea0363-4831-4e60-b383-99a1b16fccef" class="r-zl34ti alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><a href="https://tuttletwinsacademy.com/academy-teachers/"><u>Meet All 30 Academy Teachers</u></a></p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="29f55b0d-8a0f-4d5b-8aa9-e6e2e6bd8a12" class="r-m1293k"><div data-rid="385dd8a0-3777-4c11-afd1-b7c4bf06e931" class="r-1rfeyd5"><div data-rid="995370f2-1999-4cc9-93b8-70b63b40f569" class="r-ovjbrj"><div data-rid="4086860c-be07-4e4b-9e55-89647e1d1e1e" class="r-1ikohr8 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2>Six Things You Won't Find Anywhere Else</h2></span></div><div data-rid="df395416-5ab1-4d61-8beb-3abfd3b6f7e5" class="r-93xtma alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Every education platform says they're different. Here's what actually makes Academy different — with the evidence behind each claim.</p></span></div></div><div class="r-1buas78" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="f33e72f2-c04b-496c-926c-e0db6114797b" class="r-5uhe1f"><div data-rid="9490b165-c2c1-4268-abdb-ad63535c65e8" class="r-1ngdk42"><picture data-rid="83a72e95-8509-48a6-b080-fdae9880826b" class="r-w44c4w"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/55224d85-e3ea-4ccb-b0bc-e936c861b4ee?width=64" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/55224d85-e3ea-4ccb-b0bc-e936c861b4ee?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/55224d85-e3ea-4ccb-b0bc-e936c861b4ee?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/55224d85-e3ea-4ccb-b0bc-e936c861b4ee" class="r-pb0ken" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="13e3c828-47c5-43e6-9b4b-1b7f2650e532" class="r-ocddls"><div data-rid="427e5598-c799-4a0f-bdbe-bc1ea0552467" class="r-43hn3b alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Story-Based Learning - 93% Retention</p></span></div><div data-rid="a2a68c72-0800-4d5c-87ba-4f339a16c022" class="r-1exsv65 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Every lesson is built on a story. Not because it's more fun (it is), but because stories are how human brains actually encode and retain information. Our 93% retention rate is the measurable proof.</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="6c4de58a-e59f-4831-bb92-e7fc7beb7f4e" class="r-a7wn0q"><picture data-rid="e686a744-6918-42ca-938a-b91b5291717a" class="r-qrxha8"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/807b896a-825f-498c-97d1-f851bb78aa81?width=64" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/807b896a-825f-498c-97d1-f851bb78aa81?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/807b896a-825f-498c-97d1-f851bb78aa81?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/807b896a-825f-498c-97d1-f851bb78aa81" class="r-kkmzbd" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="ba5c4c96-eea0-4c6e-8797-c45922c6bb80" class="r-mx8vna"><div data-rid="1ffea4c7-9df3-4491-b893-2e558ceb9266" class="r-1qah2c4 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We Don't Tell Teens What to Think</p></span></div><div data-rid="0cad9db4-cd22-49cc-939b-4cab12b6d4ae" class="r-12akf46 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We give them tools to think for themselves — to analyze, question, and form their own well-reasoned conclusions. The goal is a teen who can spot a bad argument, not just recite the approved answer.</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="25777aba-6ac1-4a67-a7e3-38ecc27ae72a" class="r-7roggr"><picture data-rid="3a73e74c-e16f-4c07-bde4-ef3bca1646c8" class="r-1a1pv1n"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/b8043fb2-0e39-4730-a976-6e366e8d7be6?width=64" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/b8043fb2-0e39-4730-a976-6e366e8d7be6?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/b8043fb2-0e39-4730-a976-6e366e8d7be6?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/b8043fb2-0e39-4730-a976-6e366e8d7be6" class="r-1x03xln" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="a0eb9ae8-e7a6-490a-a1dd-d6fc5cdaaab5" class="r-1jpwozi"><div data-rid="d413e81a-d180-4d50-b5ce-549520252414" class="r-1qu0dwd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Dinner Table Moments - Built Into Every Lesson</p></span></div><div data-rid="abbd2a43-3a22-49bc-ac13-5c85b4644c4b" class="r-jlsrqv alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Each lesson is intentionally designed to spark a real family conversation. Parents don't just watch their teen learn — they learn alongside them. That connection is by design, not a happy accident.</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="59ff1228-b887-4e63-9f6c-e65001267a5b" class="r-187jiet"><picture data-rid="17bedb06-d9d6-4433-a80d-701a0beb4b61" class="r-62en06"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/ce1977c6-639d-4ca3-ad15-271c43ec0e53?width=64" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/ce1977c6-639d-4ca3-ad15-271c43ec0e53?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/ce1977c6-639